From dfae4d633fc3bc450aae1d3ef3547ad238267dfe Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ykai55 <ykai55@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 18 Aug 2026 18:53:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Add experimental Yew Clay backend

Add an opt-in native backend-driven renderer for mounting a top-level Yew component outside the browser DOM. Support text, tags, lists, attributes, form values, and tap callbacks while rejecting unsupported VNode output before host mutation.

Define direct-parent teardown ownership, synchronous owner-thread callbacks, and panic-unwind cleanup, with strict backend regression coverage.
